      "value": "I've been to large club events where the fps drops super low with everyone's avatars and dynamic bones disabled (and me in an excellent performance avatar). Cpu and gpu usage stays really low. I wonder if it's a bottleneck with IK or networking stuff.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
