      "value": "@{5f296274667e9234c9e5a439|full_name}:  the usage is staying low since the gpu needs a lot of data from the ram thta could not fit in the vram of the gpu. The ram is way slower compared to the vram of the gpu, so you bottleneck on the ram side, even more if you only have 16gb ram, since i see usage of up to 85% of my 32gb ram at a void club event with about 80 people in the lobby, and about 20 in very poor avis fully shown, the rest is on voice and avatar only, with a resolution of my vive pro at 75% to get about 25 to 35 fps",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
